+/*
+ * QEMU Apple ParavirtualizedGraphics.framework device, transport-agnostic
+ * core, for Linux hosts.
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Matthew Jackson <matthew@pq.io>
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
+ *
+ * C port of the transport-agnostic core of the macOS-host apple-gfx.m
+ * device (Phil Dennis-Jordan), backed by the external libapplegfx-vulkan
+ * library instead of Apple's ParavirtualizedGraphics.framework.
+ */
+
